   "source": [
    "## 5) Perturbation Generation (k = 8 per instance)\n",
    "\n",
    "Perturbation types:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. `synonym_substitution`\n",
    "2. `syntactic_reordering`\n",
    "3. `controlled_paraphrase`\n",
    "4. `back_translation`\n",
    "\n",
    "Generation is conservative and meaning-preserving. Each perturbation slot supports regeneration attempts (up to 3) and records pre-validation acceptance status."
   ]
  },
